{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Gales: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja17'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 17 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Sīlavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Ethics </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>7. Mālutajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Gales: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Kāḷe vā yadi vā juṇhe, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Whether the moon is waning or waxing, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>yadā vāyati māluto; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>it is cool when the gale blows. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Vātajāni hi sītāni, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Since the wind brings the cool, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>ubhotthamaparājitā”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>both are undefeated in this instance. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Mālutajātakaṁ sattamaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
